# Spotify app credentials + a user refresh token (Authorization-Code flow).
#
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
#    -> note the Client ID and Client Secret.
# 2. Generate a refresh token ONCE, out-of-band, authorizing these scopes:
#      user-read-playback-state  user-modify-playback-state
#      user-read-currently-playing  user-read-recently-played
#      playlist-read-private  playlist-modify-private  playlist-modify-public
#      user-library-read  user-library-modify
#    (run the Authorization-Code flow once in a browser; exchange the code for
#    a refresh token. The skill auto-refreshes the access token after that.)
#
# Playback control also requires Spotify Premium and an active device.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN
